  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Food, Diet and Obesity Committee is appointed to consider the role of foods, such as ‘ultra-processed foods’, and foods high in fat, salt and sugar, in a healthy diet and tackling obesity.</p>\r\n<p>Follow the&nbsp;Committee on&nbsp;X (formerly Twitter) using <a href=\"https://twitter.com/HLFoodObesity\">@HLFoodObesity</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://ukparliament.shorthandstories.com/food-diet-obesity-lords-report/index.html?utm_source=committees.parliament.uk&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=food-diet-obesity-report&amp;utm_content=inquiry-page-banner\">Read the key points in our report summary</a> and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.parliament.uk/business/lords/house-of-lords-podcast/unpacking-the-evidence/\">Listen to the Unpacking The Evidence podcast</a></p>",
